cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Hardware-Aware Embedded Python Code Generation: Dataset & Generation Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A domain-specific corpus of 17,000 instruction-to-code pairs for hardware-aware
  embedded Python on Raspberry Pi (GPIO, I2C, SPI, UART, PWM, camera/CV, sensors,
  networking/MQTT), together with the validation-in-the-loop pipeline used to
  synthesize and validate the data. This repository releases the license-verified
  pairs; the remainder will follow once their licenses are verified.
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
authors:
